WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.807 --> 01:47.096
=Episode 2=
(Is It That Hard To Friend You On Wechat)

01:48.007 --> 01:49.967
Does your mom come to cook for you?

01:51.047 --> 01:52.047
Coming for free meals?

01:52.246 --> 01:52.967
Can I?

01:54.007 --> 01:54.726
(I am)

01:54.847 --> 01:56.246
(in trouble.)

01:57.166 --> 01:58.567
Let me friend you on WeChat.

01:58.904 --> 02:00.447
My phone is out of battery.

02:14.246 --> 02:15.686
You said it earlier.

02:16.367 --> 02:18.166
Friend me on WeChat
and put a chair there.

02:18.527 --> 02:19.847
I'm getting a bit tired now.

02:19.927 --> 02:21.047
Can you put a chair here?

02:28.120 --> 02:28.847
It is hot.

02:46.367 --> 02:47.286
Why are you still up?

02:51.166 --> 02:52.646
You're finally back.

02:54.246 --> 02:56.447
Where's my roasted sweet potato?

02:59.847 --> 03:00.407
Here you are.

03:04.126 --> 03:04.847
One more.

03:07.527 --> 03:08.927
Tell me earlier if you want this.

03:09.646 --> 03:11.447
I'm not always lucky
to get them for free

03:11.527 --> 03:13.166
from a kind-hearted guy.

03:13.246 --> 03:14.286
This is my favorite.

03:18.407 --> 03:20.407
There is a trendy girl in your room.

03:21.407 --> 03:22.887
A trendy girl in my room?

03:26.367 --> 03:27.286
You went to his house?

03:27.686 --> 03:28.806
Did you see his mom then?

03:30.286 --> 03:32.246
He doesn't live with his mom.

03:33.447 --> 03:34.487
Are they not close?

03:35.166 --> 03:36.206
She let him live alone?

03:37.206 --> 03:38.166
Maybe

03:39.527 --> 03:40.726
Chen Luzhou was adopted.

03:45.487 --> 03:46.766
That day at his doorstep,

03:46.967 --> 03:48.527
I heard him arguing with his mom.

03:48.527 --> 03:49.606
His mom said things like,

03:50.087 --> 03:52.408
"when you first came to our place,
you weren't like this."

03:53.126 --> 03:54.367
Don't you think she doesn't

03:54.766 --> 03:55.967
sound like his birth mother?

03:57.126 --> 03:58.447
Right.

03:58.606 --> 03:59.686
But we can't conclude

03:59.847 --> 04:01.206
that he was adopted.

04:01.286 --> 04:03.407
Many things at his place
have his name on them.

04:04.527 --> 04:06.527
How's that related to him being adopted?

04:08.487 --> 04:10.367
I think it shows

04:10.488 --> 04:12.567
(Be a beacon of light.)
he may be a bit narcissistic.

04:13.047 --> 04:14.967
But it could also be a habit.

04:15.246 --> 04:17.126
Maybe he used to live

04:17.206 --> 04:18.326
in an environment

04:18.447 --> 04:19.646
similar to a welfare center.

04:20.206 --> 04:21.847
And he was particular about hygiene.

04:22.487 --> 04:24.246
So, he wrote his name on items.

04:25.286 --> 04:26.766
However, these are just my guesses.

04:28.126 --> 04:29.407
I might be overthinking it.

04:30.326 --> 04:32.206
You are like Sherlock Holmes.

04:33.726 --> 04:35.967
So, do you still plan to meet his mom?

04:37.686 --> 04:38.567
Yes, I do.

04:39.567 --> 04:41.047
When my mom had a car accident,

04:41.567 --> 04:43.286
I didn't see her one last time.

04:44.286 --> 04:45.007
Actually,

04:45.927 --> 04:47.166
I feel regretful about it.

04:48.606 --> 04:50.806
When I heard him arguing with his mom,

04:51.606 --> 04:52.566
his mom's voice

04:52.646 --> 04:54.126
was exactly like my mom's.

04:54.967 --> 04:55.646
Well,

04:57.847 --> 04:58.967
no matter what,

04:59.286 --> 05:00.367
I want to meet his mom.

05:00.606 --> 05:02.126
It's also good to hear her talk.

05:05.326 --> 05:07.126
Then let's go find Chen Luzhou tomorrow.

05:07.206 --> 05:08.206
Let him ask his mom out

05:08.286 --> 05:08.927
to see you.

05:09.447 --> 05:10.326
That's inappropriate.

05:10.606 --> 05:11.367
Think about it.

05:11.606 --> 05:13.646
If a stranger suddenly holds you
and says,

05:13.806 --> 05:14.246
"Yingying,"

05:14.766 --> 05:15.686
"Mr. Cai"

05:15.766 --> 05:17.007
"looks like my deceased dad,"

05:17.336 --> 05:18.527
"so I want to see him."

05:18.887 --> 05:19.686
What do you think?

05:20.407 --> 05:21.246
I might think

05:21.326 --> 05:22.806
he is crazy.

05:22.967 --> 05:23.766
Right.

05:24.166 --> 05:25.766
So, we can't be hasty.

05:26.887 --> 05:27.567
I think

05:28.206 --> 05:29.367
we can

05:29.847 --> 05:31.606
become friends with Chen Luzhou first.

05:32.087 --> 05:33.766
After we become friends,

05:33.967 --> 05:35.086
we can tell him the reason

05:35.166 --> 05:36.487
I want to meet his mom.

05:38.367 --> 05:40.047
But he is a bit difficult to deal with.

05:40.184 --> 05:41.847
I haven't friended him on WeChat.

05:42.328 --> 05:44.606
No worries.
I friended Zhu Yangwo on WeChat.

05:45.080 --> 05:45.606
What?

05:46.166 --> 05:47.206
Zhu Qizuo?

05:47.686 --> 05:49.126
He's called Zhu Yangqi.

05:49.646 --> 05:51.087
Who cares what his name is?

05:51.206 --> 05:51.726
Anyway,

05:51.806 --> 05:53.007
I just friended him on WeChat.

05:53.166 --> 05:54.047
So,

05:54.166 --> 05:55.847
I will help you inquire
about Chen Luzhou.

05:56.567 --> 05:57.487
From now on,

05:57.726 --> 05:59.246
I am your spy.

06:05.606 --> 06:06.686
What's wrong with you?

06:07.087 --> 06:08.166
Why did you climb trees?

06:27.326 --> 06:28.007
Kid.

06:28.447 --> 06:29.927
Where did he hit you?

06:30.166 --> 06:30.887
Does it hurt?

06:31.206 --> 06:31.847
Let me check.

06:32.567 --> 06:33.646
He kicked me.

06:35.806 --> 06:37.766
His shoe soles are so clean.

06:38.007 --> 06:39.967
They didn't leave a mark
on your white pants.

06:40.567 --> 06:41.967
My son must have cleaned it.

06:42.047 --> 06:42.967
What do you mean?

06:43.166 --> 06:44.606
Are you saying that my son lied?

06:44.847 --> 06:46.367
Uncle, don't get worked up.

06:46.447 --> 06:47.367
It's reasonable doubt.

06:47.416 --> 06:48.967
I'm not worked up. We're reasonable.

06:49.286 --> 06:50.527
Who are you calling "Uncle"?

06:50.887 --> 06:51.887
Do I look that old?

06:52.806 --> 06:54.367
You stay out of this.

06:59.206 --> 07:00.407
Lucy.

07:01.007 --> 07:02.526
You clean freak.

07:02.606 --> 07:03.367
Are you trying

07:03.447 --> 07:05.047
to polish the ground until it gleams?

07:08.206 --> 07:09.087
There is phlegm.

07:09.286 --> 07:10.087
What?

07:10.646 --> 07:12.166
Who did this wicked thing?

07:12.606 --> 07:14.047
The owner of the gold chain.

07:15.686 --> 07:17.567
The police station found the owner
so quickly.

07:23.967 --> 07:25.246
He hid money in the tree,

07:25.326 --> 07:26.487
but his wife found out.

07:27.087 --> 07:29.246
Since when can money be hidden in trees?

07:29.726 --> 07:31.806
Poverty really limits our imagination.

07:33.567 --> 07:35.126
So, he took revenge by spitting

07:35.286 --> 07:36.606
at your doorstep?

07:39.927 --> 07:40.927
But he got the wrong guy.

07:41.326 --> 07:42.527
So, I give him your address?

07:42.646 --> 07:43.487
No, don't do that.

07:46.527 --> 07:48.566
What happened between you and Xu Zhi

07:48.646 --> 07:49.927
last night?

07:52.887 --> 07:53.407
Come on.

07:53.847 --> 07:54.606
I knew it.

08:00.447 --> 08:02.766
She is experienced.

08:03.967 --> 08:06.847
You brought her home
to roast sweet potatoes.

08:07.206 --> 08:09.246
Weren't you falling into her trap?

08:11.087 --> 08:11.646
Move aside.

08:16.446 --> 08:17.286
Take off your shoes.

08:17.807 --> 08:19.246
Anyway, you'll mop the floor.

08:24.647 --> 08:25.166
Alright.

08:25.607 --> 08:26.967
I'm telling you, Lucy,

08:28.286 --> 08:30.007
If she wasn't trying to flirt with you,

08:30.166 --> 08:32.406
I'd be renamed as Stylish Zhu.

08:47.847 --> 08:48.687
Which do you

08:48.967 --> 08:51.286
find more romantic?
Roasting sweet potatoes with her

08:51.927 --> 08:54.206
or having a candlelight lunch with me?

09:03.087 --> 09:04.007
I prefer to choose her.

09:04.366 --> 09:05.406
Feeling awkward is fine.

09:06.087 --> 09:06.847
I can't choose you

09:07.526 --> 09:08.607
in case you'll fall for me.

09:09.007 --> 09:09.687
Wait.

09:11.047 --> 09:12.927
You're afraid I'll fall for you?

09:13.047 --> 09:14.847
Aren't you afraid she will do the same?

09:14.927 --> 09:16.087
She has a boyfriend.

09:16.406 --> 09:17.246
What can I do?

09:17.927 --> 09:18.887
She didn't say anything.

09:23.486 --> 09:26.087
You were expecting her to say something
to you, weren't you?

09:27.647 --> 09:28.406
I'm telling you,

09:29.087 --> 09:31.007
Xu Zhi is a heartbreaker.

09:31.366 --> 09:33.047
You're too naive.

09:33.166 --> 09:34.007
Alright,

09:34.126 --> 09:35.847
I'll avoid seeing her again, okay?

09:37.087 --> 09:37.446
Okay.

09:39.847 --> 09:41.784
(8090 Convenience Store)

09:46.526 --> 09:47.166
Take it back.

09:47.366 --> 09:48.767
I won't raise it anymore.

09:49.286 --> 09:50.526
You've grown taller.

09:51.526 --> 09:52.366
What did you eat?

09:52.847 --> 09:54.166
I'm not joking with you.

09:55.160 --> 09:56.056
Get down.

09:58.047 --> 09:59.166
If you don't take it back,

09:59.607 --> 10:00.687
I'll cook it tomorrow.

10:01.087 --> 10:01.927
Make turtle soup.

10:02.047 --> 10:03.286
Why make turtle soup?

10:03.366 --> 10:04.126
It's so cute.

10:04.246 --> 10:05.007
Why not raise it?

10:05.566 --> 10:06.727
It's not cute at all.

10:07.166 --> 10:09.406
It's like Chen Luzhou,

10:10.126 --> 10:11.286
loving to run away from home

10:11.486 --> 10:12.647
and frequently going missing.

10:12.927 --> 10:14.246
Maybe you are overstepping.

10:14.927 --> 10:16.046
Can't I do something

10:16.126 --> 10:16.927
and go out to relax?

10:18.887 --> 10:20.607
Have you considered my feelings?

10:20.927 --> 10:22.246
You rarely answer your phone.

10:22.687 --> 10:23.566
Now it's worse.

10:23.847 --> 10:25.047
You live far away from me.

10:25.406 --> 10:26.446
If I need you,

10:26.526 --> 10:27.526
I can't even reach you.

10:28.536 --> 10:29.687
You have trouble in school?

10:30.206 --> 10:31.647
No, I don't.

10:33.366 --> 10:33.887
Alright.

10:34.767 --> 10:36.087
Don't come unless you're dying.

10:36.526 --> 10:36.927
Luzhou.

10:38.087 --> 10:38.486
Luzhou.

10:39.007 --> 10:41.526
So, when I'm about to die,
I can come to you?

10:43.246 --> 10:44.847
Chen Xingqi, are you a fool?

10:45.566 --> 10:47.286
Can't you tell I was joking?

10:49.126 --> 10:49.687
Alright.

10:50.392 --> 10:52.248
If you don't want me
to see you, just say it.

10:54.647 --> 10:55.526
Alright, go ahead.

10:56.206 --> 10:56.687
What's it?

10:58.647 --> 11:00.807
I want to head to the mountains
with my classmates.

11:01.286 --> 11:02.047
Mom didn't agree.

11:04.607 --> 11:05.566
So, you want someone

11:05.727 --> 11:07.166
to go with you kids, right?

11:09.326 --> 11:09.887
Alright.

11:10.526 --> 11:11.246
Pay me 800 a day.

11:11.566 --> 11:12.526
I can go with you then.

11:13.246 --> 11:13.967
Deal.

11:15.047 --> 11:15.607
Me.

11:16.246 --> 11:16.927
Me.

11:18.446 --> 11:19.126
Add another 500.

11:19.607 --> 11:20.607
Zhu Yangqi will join us.

11:21.126 --> 11:22.446
He can be an art teacher.

11:22.607 --> 11:24.206
How come I'm paid three hundred less?

11:26.727 --> 11:28.406
So, it is a deal?

11:28.607 --> 11:29.047
Luzhou.

11:29.847 --> 11:30.967
It depends on my mood.

11:32.047 --> 11:32.767
Yes.

11:36.007 --> 11:37.967
I'll spend the holiday with my brother.

12:13.927 --> 12:18.936
(Ten Things to Do after Graduation)

12:21.575 --> 12:23.832
(10. Watch the sunrise
with someone you like)

12:25.007 --> 12:26.007
Abandon.

12:27.446 --> 12:28.286
Abandon.

12:29.446 --> 12:30.286
Analyze.

12:31.687 --> 12:32.246
Analyze.

12:32.326 --> 12:32.927
Zhi.

12:33.687 --> 12:34.967
Are you in love?

12:35.486 --> 12:36.326
No.

12:37.566 --> 12:38.887
I saw the list

12:39.126 --> 12:40.246
in your room.

12:40.406 --> 12:42.647
Watch the sunrise with someone you like?

12:43.406 --> 12:44.126
What's that?

12:44.326 --> 12:45.687
It was listed by Cai Yingying.

12:45.887 --> 12:46.927
She wanted to make a video

12:49.126 --> 12:51.486
about ten things to do after graduation.

12:54.807 --> 12:56.366
Since Yingying wanted

12:56.526 --> 12:57.847
to do it with you,

12:57.967 --> 12:59.727
do you want me to financially help you

13:00.326 --> 13:02.526
with your graduation trip?

13:02.526 --> 13:04.047
The exam results will come out soon.

13:04.246 --> 13:05.927
I should just study at home.

13:06.767 --> 13:08.126
As the old saying goes,

13:09.526 --> 13:11.366
traveling benefits people more
than reading.

13:12.007 --> 13:13.326
Now that you've read books,

13:13.607 --> 13:14.767
it's time to travel.

13:14.887 --> 13:16.607
Go see the great landscapes.

13:16.847 --> 13:17.847
- Isn't that right?
- Xu.

13:18.406 --> 13:20.446
Traveling will cost a lot of money.

13:20.807 --> 13:22.607
Don't you know our financial situation?

13:23.767 --> 13:25.366
The money you guaranteed for others

13:25.446 --> 13:26.566
is still unpaid.

13:27.087 --> 13:27.687
Yeah,

13:28.047 --> 13:29.927
but Mr. Cai has already paid it back
for me.

13:30.007 --> 13:31.126
Don't worry about this.

13:31.206 --> 13:31.687
Moreover,

13:31.887 --> 13:33.326
someone else owes me money.

13:33.326 --> 13:33.887
Who?

13:34.047 --> 13:35.768
Mr. Lin, the lottery ticket seller?

13:35.847 --> 13:37.246
He owes our family five million.

13:38.406 --> 13:39.526
Zhi.

13:39.647 --> 13:41.286
I have big news.

13:41.807 --> 13:42.767
Yingying.

13:43.647 --> 13:45.240
- Have you eaten?
- Hello, Mr. Xu.

13:45.240 --> 13:47.567
I haven't eaten. But it doesn't matter.

13:47.647 --> 13:49.486
- Guess what?
- What happened to your hair?

13:50.406 --> 13:51.767
It was dyed black yesterday.

13:52.647 --> 13:53.446
Listen to me.

13:53.526 --> 13:54.366
I have good news.

13:59.246 --> 14:00.847
I'm going out
with Yingying for two days.

14:02.326 --> 14:04.086
Weren't you saying
you'd save money for me

14:04.166 --> 14:05.126
and stay home?

14:05.727 --> 14:07.887
Didn't you tell me
to see the landscapes?

14:08.087 --> 14:09.112
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

14:11.087 --> 14:12.807
By the way, where are you going?

14:12.888 --> 14:13.687
How many people?

14:14.126 --> 14:15.007
With any boys?

14:17.286 --> 14:18.126
What are you posting?

14:20.536 --> 14:21.326
Let me see.

14:22.446 --> 14:23.967
Spitting

14:24.126 --> 14:25.647
makes you lose money.

14:35.143 --> 14:37.144
(Spitting makes you lose money)

14:40.687 --> 14:42.087
Isn't that Xu Zhi's boyfriend?

14:45.687 --> 14:46.967
Were you just avoiding him?

14:47.406 --> 14:48.887
Don't be silly. Let's go.

14:49.767 --> 14:50.927
We have to catch the bus now.

14:52.767 --> 14:54.406
Wait, what do you actually mean, Lucy?

14:54.486 --> 14:55.566
You have a crush on Xu Zhi?

14:56.366 --> 14:57.567
I'm saying something immoral.

14:57.647 --> 14:58.807
If you really want to steal

14:58.927 --> 14:59.767
his girlfriend,

14:59.847 --> 15:00.366
it's okay.

15:00.526 --> 15:02.286
I'll back you up, buddy.

15:02.406 --> 15:02.967
But,

15:03.406 --> 15:04.486
why did you just avoid him?

15:05.206 --> 15:05.887
I'm just worried

15:05.967 --> 15:07.486
if his girlfriend is into me,

15:07.847 --> 15:09.847
can't I try to avoid confronting him?

15:10.126 --> 15:11.007
Drop the act.

15:11.166 --> 15:12.967
You reacted like having an affair.

15:14.286 --> 15:15.446
Also, I'm telling you,

15:15.887 --> 15:16.687
Xu Zhi's boyfriend

15:16.767 --> 15:17.767
isn't a good person.

15:18.286 --> 15:19.326
She made bad choices.

15:19.566 --> 15:20.406
Be careful.

15:21.647 --> 15:22.607
Did you hear me?

15:47.486 --> 15:48.246
Do you know him?

15:49.366 --> 15:49.967
Who?

15:50.566 --> 15:51.526
Xu Zhi's boyfriend.

15:52.887 --> 15:54.166
I know him very well.

15:55.406 --> 15:56.727
His name is Tan Xu.

15:56.967 --> 15:58.246
We went to the same high school.

15:58.246 --> 16:00.126
In his second year,
he had a problem with a guy.

16:00.366 --> 16:01.326
He told everyone

16:01.767 --> 16:03.887
that he excluded him.

16:04.767 --> 16:06.047
That's not even the main point.

16:06.326 --> 16:08.246
He presented the school

16:08.566 --> 16:10.687
with a depression diagnosis certificate.

16:11.047 --> 16:12.406
He even got that guy expelled.

16:12.887 --> 16:13.967
Most disgustingly,

16:14.647 --> 16:16.687
that diagnosis certificate
was actually fake.

16:17.126 --> 16:18.366
How do you know it was fake?

16:18.776 --> 16:20.007
Do you remember Feng Jin?

16:20.366 --> 16:21.566
My classmate in middle school.

16:21.767 --> 16:23.246
Feng Jin was close to him back then.

16:23.486 --> 16:24.406
He told me personally.

16:28.967 --> 16:30.807
Listen, there are
even more outrageous things.

16:30.807 --> 16:32.440
- Alright, stop talking.
- That is...

16:32.727 --> 16:33.326
Let's sleep.

16:57.063 --> 16:59.927
(Fu Yu Villa)

17:00.007 --> 17:01.126
Hello, your room card.

17:01.486 --> 17:01.967
Thank you.

17:03.767 --> 17:04.607
Put it away.

17:04.887 --> 17:05.286
Okay.

17:05.887 --> 17:06.887
Still not feeling well?

17:07.047 --> 17:07.967
I got car sick.

17:08.406 --> 17:10.166
I'll ask Mr. Fu for some ginger slices.

17:10.166 --> 17:11.647
- Alright.
- Ginger water will help.

17:13.246 --> 17:14.607
Who needs ginger slices?

17:15.727 --> 17:16.687
- Mr. Fu.
- Mr. Fu.

17:18.166 --> 17:20.687
What brings you here?

17:20.927 --> 17:22.767
It's been a long time.

17:22.927 --> 17:24.126
Have you forgotten me?

17:24.206 --> 17:25.007
How could it be?

17:26.007 --> 17:27.446
Want to ride a bike, don't you?

17:27.576 --> 17:28.967
I haven't ridden for two years.

17:29.112 --> 17:30.807
You aren't here for a vacation, right?

17:30.887 --> 17:31.566
It's a secret.

17:33.446 --> 17:34.767
Get her some ginger slices.

17:35.286 --> 17:36.046
Thank you.

17:36.126 --> 17:37.166
Put them in water.

17:38.007 --> 17:38.967
I want to talk

17:39.286 --> 17:40.206
to your boss, not you.

17:40.206 --> 17:41.727
Call him out. Where is he?

17:41.807 --> 17:43.486
Call him out. Come on.

17:43.566 --> 17:44.166
Sorry.

17:44.366 --> 17:45.526
We only have spring water.

17:46.047 --> 17:47.047
What's going on?

17:47.607 --> 17:48.967
Stop making a scene here.

17:48.967 --> 17:49.847
This isn't your home.

17:50.446 --> 17:51.087
You may go.

17:52.566 --> 17:53.526
What's wrong?

17:55.007 --> 17:56.566
I can't drink this terrible water.

17:56.727 --> 17:57.526
Why did you say it?

17:57.887 --> 17:59.206
We just have spring water here.

17:59.406 --> 18:01.007
I'll tell you one last time.

18:01.526 --> 18:02.647
If you don't like it,

18:03.246 --> 18:04.647
then boil it before drinking.

18:04.847 --> 18:06.406
What if I get kidney stones then?

18:06.486 --> 18:07.126
Who will

18:07.446 --> 18:08.047
be responsible?

18:08.246 --> 18:09.486
Get what?

18:10.246 --> 18:11.687
Kidney stones.

18:11.767 --> 18:12.727
Kidney stones?

18:13.767 --> 18:16.326
Kid, have you grown up physically?

18:16.927 --> 18:18.486
You're being rude.

18:18.566 --> 18:19.246
Kid.

18:19.326 --> 18:20.326
You calm down.

18:20.607 --> 18:21.767
My brother is coming soon.

18:22.126 --> 18:22.847
You wait.

18:25.166 --> 18:26.326
Welcome, this way, please.

18:29.406 --> 18:31.166
Chen Xingqi,
how many times have I told you?

18:31.406 --> 18:33.366
Don't call me for no reason, okay?

18:38.486 --> 18:39.887
We met again. What a coincidence.

18:41.166 --> 18:43.007
No, it can't be such a coincidence.

18:43.087 --> 18:43.767
She planned it.

18:44.126 --> 18:44.767
His parents.

18:46.607 --> 18:48.446
Cai Yingying messaged me
a couple of days ago.

18:48.607 --> 18:49.727
Now I think I know why.

18:50.767 --> 18:52.486
The owner of the villa
is my dad's friend.

18:52.727 --> 18:54.328
Yingying and I came for a vacation.

18:54.566 --> 18:55.326
Have your parents

18:55.486 --> 18:56.206
arrived?

18:56.967 --> 18:57.566
My parents?

18:57.927 --> 18:59.406
Didn't you come with your family?

19:00.047 --> 19:00.847
Who told you that?

19:02.566 --> 19:04.526
Zhu Yangqi said Chen Luzhou

19:04.727 --> 19:06.166
is going to spend a vacation

19:06.326 --> 19:07.887
with his family at Fu Yu Villa today.

19:08.286 --> 19:09.126
If you go there,

19:09.566 --> 19:10.887
you'll definitely see his mom.

19:14.967 --> 19:16.126
This boy is Lucy's family.

19:18.424 --> 19:19.847
- He's my brother.
- This boy?

19:19.967 --> 19:20.647
- Luzhou.
- Right.

19:21.007 --> 19:22.967
He has no sense of offering service.

19:23.096 --> 19:25.560
This water is terrible.
But he refused to change it.

19:25.647 --> 19:26.246
What's wrong?

19:26.727 --> 19:27.687
You are

19:27.767 --> 19:28.526
so picky.

19:28.887 --> 19:29.647
You're his brother?

19:31.326 --> 19:32.687
He isn't used to our water.

19:33.286 --> 19:34.286
Unfortunately,

19:34.687 --> 19:36.566
we only have spring water,

19:36.647 --> 19:37.526
not purified water.

19:37.976 --> 19:39.047
Can't it be delivered?

19:39.246 --> 19:40.047
No.

19:40.504 --> 19:42.616
It takes two hours to get here.
Nobody does it.

19:42.967 --> 19:44.126
And the guests who come here

19:44.206 --> 19:45.566
like to drink spring water.

19:46.087 --> 19:48.007
No one wants ordinary water.

19:51.486 --> 19:52.526
How about this?

19:53.887 --> 19:55.406
I'll refund your room charge.

19:55.486 --> 19:56.286
You can leave then.

19:56.526 --> 19:57.087
Wait a minute.

19:58.007 --> 19:59.567
If it's just about water,

19:59.647 --> 20:00.607
I can go down to buy it.

20:01.446 --> 20:02.326
How are you going?

20:02.727 --> 20:03.486
By driving.

20:04.847 --> 20:05.807
Can you drive?

20:05.807 --> 20:06.904
You have a license?

20:07.366 --> 20:08.486
Do you want to be detained?

20:08.607 --> 20:09.486
Alright, I was wrong.

20:09.887 --> 20:11.366
I should comply with the law.

20:11.927 --> 20:12.727
I have a license.

20:14.047 --> 20:15.246
Where can I buy water

20:15.486 --> 20:16.166
around here?

20:16.927 --> 20:17.927
Can you lend me a car?

20:18.486 --> 20:19.246
I can pay money.

20:19.326 --> 20:21.246
A bike or a car is fine.

20:27.047 --> 20:27.687
No car.

20:28.440 --> 20:29.526
Figure it out yourself.

20:30.727 --> 20:31.807
You bad kid.

20:32.286 --> 20:33.566
Luzhou, he insulted me.

20:33.647 --> 20:34.446
What a hot temper!

20:34.927 --> 20:35.887
Being single for decades

20:36.206 --> 20:37.767
makes his temper get worse.

20:38.847 --> 20:40.126
Can I friend you on WeChat?

20:40.526 --> 20:42.046
If you and your brother have anything,

20:42.126 --> 20:42.727
just tell me.

20:43.166 --> 20:44.007
For example,

20:44.887 --> 20:46.486
borrowing a car from Mr. Fu.

20:47.607 --> 20:48.446
Chen Luzhou,

20:49.087 --> 20:50.446
I pay you 800 a day.

20:50.647 --> 20:51.446
It's not for you

20:51.526 --> 20:53.807
to friend a girl here.

20:54.087 --> 20:55.246
Help me get the water.

20:55.326 --> 20:56.126
Come on.

20:56.126 --> 20:57.976
- Go to our room. Hurry.
- Let me friend you.

20:59.727 --> 21:00.206
Zhu Yangqi.

21:00.687 --> 21:01.687
Coming.

21:02.007 --> 21:02.847
I have to go.

21:03.687 --> 21:04.246
Come on.

21:09.767 --> 21:11.526
It's hard to friend him on WeChat.

21:15.206 --> 21:16.727
It's all Zhu Yangqi's fault.

21:16.967 --> 21:17.967
Just Luzhou's brother.

21:18.286 --> 21:19.967
He said Luzhou came with his parents.

21:20.206 --> 21:21.847
We came in a hurry

21:22.007 --> 21:22.887
all the way.

21:23.047 --> 21:23.927
I even got car sick.

21:27.326 --> 21:28.126
So bitter.

21:31.087 --> 21:31.927
What are you doing?

21:33.647 --> 21:36.047
I'm thinking about
how to friend Chen Luzhou on WeChat.

21:36.286 --> 21:37.767
Since his mother doesn't come,

21:37.847 --> 21:39.366
we have to win him over first.

21:40.087 --> 21:41.007
Isn't this easy?

21:41.647 --> 21:44.166
Let me teach you some tips

21:44.807 --> 21:46.366
for making friends.

21:47.087 --> 21:48.807
If you want to friend a hot guy,

21:49.206 --> 21:50.647
remember the following things.

21:51.246 --> 21:51.847
First,

21:52.246 --> 21:53.566
surpass him and defeat him

21:53.927 --> 21:55.366
in his area of expertise

21:55.526 --> 21:56.687
to attract his attention.

21:57.647 --> 21:58.326
Second,

21:58.687 --> 22:00.286
in a field he is unfamiliar with,

22:00.807 --> 22:02.126
try to be humble,

22:02.486 --> 22:03.927
lest you hurt his pride.

22:04.967 --> 22:05.967
Third,

22:06.807 --> 22:08.166
and last but not least...

22:13.087 --> 22:14.126
Have you remembered it?

22:14.366 --> 22:15.566
They are important

22:15.767 --> 22:16.927
and I told nobody before.

22:17.166 --> 22:18.526
You must keep it in mind

22:18.727 --> 22:19.767
and get the point.

22:28.286 --> 22:29.567
Could you ask Cai Yingying

22:29.647 --> 22:30.807
if Xu Zhi is free later?

22:33.126 --> 22:34.326
You're finally ready to act.

22:35.246 --> 22:36.727
Yeah, I can't wait.

22:37.687 --> 22:40.007
What do you plan to do?

22:41.047 --> 22:41.647
What can I do?

22:41.727 --> 22:42.647
Let Lun get in there

22:42.807 --> 22:43.727
to score.

22:44.566 --> 22:46.366
No, I mean Xu Zhi.

22:46.446 --> 22:47.967
Why are you talking about Lun?

22:48.326 --> 22:49.206
I mean the game.

22:49.286 --> 22:50.687
Why did you bring up Xu Zhi?

22:51.326 --> 22:53.007
You just asked if she is free.

22:53.647 --> 22:56.007
Although she's here for you,

22:56.087 --> 22:58.246
and her boyfriend isn't a good guy,

22:58.326 --> 22:59.927
they haven't broken up yet.

23:00.486 --> 23:02.166
You better not mess this up.

23:03.887 --> 23:06.486
Who promised to back me up before?

23:08.727 --> 23:09.406
Come on.

23:10.087 --> 23:12.126
Even so, let me prepare mentally.

23:13.366 --> 23:14.047
Buddy.

23:15.087 --> 23:16.607
How can I borrow a car without Xu Zhi?

23:17.047 --> 23:17.847
Without a car,

23:17.927 --> 23:19.727
how can I buy water for you guys?

23:20.526 --> 23:21.366
You also can't

23:21.446 --> 23:22.607
drink spring water, can you?

23:23.527 --> 23:24.280
(One New Message)

23:24.967 --> 23:26.206
Who is it? So annoying.

23:29.687 --> 23:30.366
Zhi.

23:31.607 --> 23:32.687
Big news.

23:32.927 --> 23:33.566
What is it?

23:34.007 --> 23:34.727
Listen.

23:35.927 --> 23:36.607
Hello!

23:37.087 --> 23:39.286
Chen Luzhou asks if Xu Zhi is free now

23:39.446 --> 23:41.326
to take him to buy purified water.

23:43.887 --> 23:45.286
Congrats, Zhi.

23:45.446 --> 23:47.526
Just one step away from meeting his mom.

23:47.847 --> 23:49.647
You must seize the opportunity.

23:49.767 --> 23:50.566
Hurry up.

23:50.807 --> 23:51.967
Friend him on WeChat.

23:52.687 --> 23:53.446
Come on.

23:55.406 --> 23:55.807
Hurry up.

23:57.326 --> 23:58.166
Bye-bye.

24:21.687 --> 24:23.727
(If you want to friend a hot guy,)

24:23.887 --> 24:24.566
(first,)

24:24.847 --> 24:26.767
(defeat him in his area of expertise)

24:27.087 --> 24:28.206
(to attract his attention.)

24:28.472 --> 24:29.720
(Set as background)

24:32.007 --> 24:33.126
Do you have a charger?

24:39.566 --> 24:40.087
Thank you.

24:40.406 --> 24:41.007
No problem.

24:48.519 --> 24:53.624
(The Bicycle Thief, comments)

25:05.767 --> 25:06.727
Listen to music?

25:07.486 --> 25:07.967
Up to you.

25:25.406 --> 25:27.087
I really like this movie.

25:28.007 --> 25:29.727
It shows the indifference

25:30.007 --> 25:32.366
and poverty in Rome after World War II

25:32.687 --> 25:33.967
and the importance of family.

25:34.446 --> 25:36.406
Although it is a tragic story,

25:36.647 --> 25:38.406
it also conveys a sense of hope.

25:39.126 --> 25:40.566
No matter how tough life is,

25:40.927 --> 25:42.047
with the warmth of family,

25:42.687 --> 25:44.406
there will always be a new day.

25:45.526 --> 25:46.406
You have seen it.

25:47.206 --> 25:48.486
I like it when the director

25:48.566 --> 25:49.687
integrated his metaphor

25:49.767 --> 25:51.246
in that kind of audiovisual language.

25:51.566 --> 25:52.366
For example,

25:52.526 --> 25:54.246
when Ricci passed under the bridge,

25:54.326 --> 25:54.887
he seized

25:54.967 --> 25:56.727
the man with a flower pot
in the bike basket.

25:56.727 --> 25:57.767
The director tried to say

25:57.847 --> 25:59.727
- the flower pot means...
- It was debunked.

25:59.727 --> 26:00.687
That was just a prop.

26:00.967 --> 26:01.927
Don't overinterpret it.

26:02.847 --> 26:03.727
Alright.

26:06.206 --> 26:08.047
(Cai Yingying must be tricking me.)

26:08.927 --> 26:11.007
(I knew I couldn't trust her.)

26:13.446 --> 26:14.047
By the way,

26:15.087 --> 26:17.807
can you help me with navigation?
I'm not familiar with the road.

26:20.807 --> 26:21.446
Password?

26:21.927 --> 26:22.727
Four ones.

26:23.126 --> 26:24.727
Why not set it as your birthday?

26:25.406 --> 26:26.526
This is my birth date.

26:27.967 --> 26:29.126
Good day.

26:31.326 --> 26:33.046
You have entered the mountain route.

26:33.126 --> 26:35.166
The journey takes about one hour
and 45 minutes.

26:35.526 --> 26:36.566
The road is winding.

26:36.647 --> 26:37.607
Can you hear it?

26:37.687 --> 26:39.607
Keep your speed
within 40 kilometers per hour.

26:40.887 --> 26:42.446
Some sections have no signal coverage.

26:42.526 --> 26:44.366
Just download offline maps in advance.

26:45.486 --> 26:46.526
(Have you friended him?)

26:47.727 --> 26:50.486
(Your advice doesn't work.)

26:58.206 --> 26:59.807
(After all, he is a freak.)

27:04.007 --> 27:05.286
(You think about)

27:05.807 --> 27:08.047
(what I should do to make him
take me to see his mom.)

27:10.446 --> 27:11.566
(Be his girlfriend.)

27:12.007 --> 27:13.767
(Then he will take you
to meet his parents.)

27:17.807 --> 27:19.406
(What if he has a girlfriend?)

27:22.486 --> 27:24.007
(Then be his dad's girlfriend.)

27:24.087 --> 27:25.647
(His mom will surely come to find you.)

27:29.607 --> 27:30.166
(Yingying.)

27:31.007 --> 27:33.007
(Go take a morality class.)

27:33.087 --> 27:34.366
(You need proper moral values.)

27:37.687 --> 27:39.807
Consecutive sharp turns
three kilometers ahead.

27:39.887 --> 27:41.286
Watch out for oncoming vehicles.

27:41.366 --> 27:43.087
Do you have a girlfriend?

27:44.526 --> 27:45.126
No.

27:48.607 --> 27:49.847
(I really miss you.)

27:50.007 --> 27:51.206
(Are you still mad at me?)

27:51.446 --> 27:52.246
(Chen Luzhou.)

27:52.566 --> 27:54.246
(I'm crazy about you.)

27:55.687 --> 27:56.647
She's not my girlfriend.

28:02.566 --> 28:04.087
Your screensaver is quite nice.

28:05.607 --> 28:06.687
It was taken during a game.

28:10.566 --> 28:11.446
Game?

28:13.047 --> 28:13.607
What's wrong?

28:25.526 --> 28:26.366
It seems like

28:26.446 --> 28:27.687
your chat is inconsistent.

28:28.486 --> 28:30.607
I'm thinking. Don't disturb me for now.

28:30.687 --> 28:31.687
Let me think carefully.

28:33.326 --> 28:34.526
(Why are you being mad?)

28:43.607 --> 28:45.727
(No.1 High School)
Chen Luzhou, go!

28:50.055 --> 28:52.967
(Ruijun VS. No.1 High School,
Second Quarter)

29:08.647 --> 29:09.486
Xu Zhi.

29:10.206 --> 29:11.608
Give this to sports coordinator.

29:17.647 --> 29:19.166
No.1 High School, go!

29:19.326 --> 29:20.727
No.1 High School, go!

29:20.807 --> 29:22.286
No.1 High School, go!

29:22.446 --> 29:23.887
No.1 High School, go!

29:24.007 --> 29:25.286
No.1 High School, go!

29:25.366 --> 29:26.486
Help me give it to that guy.

29:27.767 --> 29:28.566
Sports coordinator.

29:39.446 --> 29:40.206
Thanks.

29:43.687 --> 29:44.166
Xu Zhi.

29:44.607 --> 29:45.927
Who did you give the water to?

29:46.526 --> 29:47.566
I don't know either.

29:48.344 --> 29:49.087
Forget it.

30:03.767 --> 30:04.887
(So, it was him.)

30:05.486 --> 30:07.246
(He's still so narcissistic.)

30:12.647 --> 30:14.486
(She's good)

30:14.727 --> 30:15.647
(at flirting.)

30:16.967 --> 30:18.286
(Is she trying to attract me?)

30:40.007 --> 30:40.807
What's wrong now?

30:41.246 --> 30:41.807
Luzhou.

30:42.007 --> 30:43.887
There's nothing to eat
in this lousy villa.

30:44.366 --> 30:45.607
Buy me griddled bullfrog.

30:45.927 --> 30:46.526
I want it.

30:47.126 --> 30:48.727
I don't offer this service.

30:49.126 --> 30:51.446
If you want full delivery service,
raise my pay tenfold.

30:51.647 --> 30:52.446
Chen Luzhou.

30:52.687 --> 30:54.126
You've gone crazy for money, huh?

30:54.520 --> 30:55.647
You're overcharging me.

30:56.246 --> 30:58.007
Anyway, I want griddled bullfrog.

30:58.087 --> 30:58.526
No way.

30:59.326 --> 31:00.647
Who did you go out with?

31:01.047 --> 31:01.967
What took you so long?

31:03.166 --> 31:04.647
The girl you ran into in the lobby.

31:05.887 --> 31:06.847
The girl

31:07.087 --> 31:09.446
who intended to drive without a license?

31:10.047 --> 31:11.326
Can you keep your voice down?

31:11.406 --> 31:12.246
She can hear you.

31:14.087 --> 31:15.047
Pretty lady.

31:15.366 --> 31:16.647
If you want to date my brother,

31:16.767 --> 31:18.206
buy me griddled bullfrog

31:18.326 --> 31:19.126
without coriander.

31:19.206 --> 31:20.286
I've bought sickness pills.

31:21.406 --> 31:23.687
What did your brother say?
He wanted griddled bullfrog?

31:25.166 --> 31:26.246
Just ignore him.

31:26.486 --> 31:27.126
He's spoiled.

31:29.406 --> 31:30.887
There's a restaurant right here.

31:32.446 --> 31:33.007
Let's go.

31:33.246 --> 31:34.607
Just buy it for your brother.

31:35.246 --> 31:36.326
(So thoughtful.)

31:36.967 --> 31:38.847
(You are falling for me.)

31:39.126 --> 31:40.166
(Stop pretending.)

31:44.727 --> 31:47.126
What flavor does your brother like?

31:48.607 --> 31:49.887
The fermented bean one is good.

31:51.406 --> 31:52.486
Just say it, Xu Zhi.

31:52.607 --> 31:53.406
Are you pursuing...?

31:54.967 --> 31:55.326
Stop!

31:55.406 --> 31:56.286
You can't catch me.

32:11.526 --> 32:12.206
Are you okay?

32:28.326 --> 32:29.647
If you need me to help explain,

32:29.887 --> 32:30.687
I can go.

32:31.607 --> 32:32.967
You order. I'll be right back.

32:38.366 --> 32:39.166
Tan Xu.

32:50.847 --> 32:52.087
What can we talk about?

32:53.206 --> 32:55.007
Can you stop being so disheartened?

32:57.206 --> 32:58.687
How I am doesn't concern you.

33:00.526 --> 33:02.807
In my second year of high school,
my dad got depression.

33:03.326 --> 33:04.967
I was also muddled all day.

33:05.286 --> 33:06.727
Your words enlightened me.

33:06.807 --> 33:09.007
You said that there is no real despair,

33:09.087 --> 33:11.007
only prisoners of their thoughts.

33:12.687 --> 33:13.286
Sorry.

33:14.166 --> 33:15.326
Those aren't my words.

33:16.206 --> 33:18.007
I saw them in a book.

33:21.647 --> 33:23.047
I just don't get it.

33:23.847 --> 33:25.406
Are those words that good?

33:26.246 --> 33:28.166
Why do you always use them
to lecture me?

33:28.504 --> 33:30.246
You're sad for failing
College Entrance Examination.

33:30.246 --> 33:31.246
I understand you.

33:31.246 --> 33:32.647
But you don't need to be hostile.

33:33.047 --> 33:34.566
The one who failed the exam is me,

33:34.647 --> 33:35.366
not you.

33:36.406 --> 33:37.847
As a winner,

33:38.647 --> 33:39.366
stop showing off

33:39.446 --> 33:40.446
in front of me.

33:44.687 --> 33:45.126
Xu Zhi.

33:46.807 --> 33:49.206
Do you know
what your biggest problem is?

33:51.607 --> 33:53.126
You are always emotionally stable.

33:54.206 --> 33:54.927
But actually,

33:55.486 --> 33:56.967
it's because you have poor empathy.

33:58.007 --> 33:59.767
You can't know what others are thinking.

34:05.286 --> 34:06.887
No, one more round.

34:07.727 --> 34:09.607
Best two out of three. A game is a game.

34:11.286 --> 34:12.286
Now that you lost,

34:12.366 --> 34:13.046
you promise me

34:13.126 --> 34:14.927
not to point this gun at others.

34:15.007 --> 34:16.326
It's dangerous. Got it?

34:17.526 --> 34:18.967
Here you are.

34:19.967 --> 34:21.406
Thank you.

34:23.727 --> 34:24.206
Wait.

34:24.286 --> 34:25.847
Take your gun.

34:26.206 --> 34:27.087
Thank you.

34:37.047 --> 34:37.847
Because of him?

34:38.566 --> 34:39.406
It's between us.

34:39.486 --> 34:40.607
Nothing to do with him.

34:42.446 --> 34:43.767
Didn't he ask you

34:44.607 --> 34:45.607
make a clean break

34:46.166 --> 34:46.967
with me?

34:47.166 --> 34:48.486
You and I were never together.

34:49.526 --> 34:50.687
Because I failed the exam

34:52.727 --> 34:54.007
and you found a better guy?

34:55.007 --> 34:56.486
That's why you deny our past?

34:59.047 --> 34:59.767
Xu Zhi.

35:00.607 --> 35:01.366
I thought

35:01.446 --> 35:02.566
we were in a relationship.

35:03.007 --> 35:04.286
I used to help you so much.

35:04.687 --> 35:05.607
So what?

35:05.967 --> 35:07.887
Do I have to like you
just because I'm grateful?

35:17.126 --> 35:18.206
It seems I overthought it.

35:19.246 --> 35:20.446
I thought you were different.

35:21.326 --> 35:22.526
You wouldn't be distant

35:24.047 --> 35:25.007
because I'm depressed.

35:26.566 --> 35:27.126
In the end,

35:27.206 --> 35:28.286
you aren't different.

35:29.566 --> 35:31.246
You still look down on me.

35:32.047 --> 35:33.326
Have you seen a doctor?

35:34.406 --> 35:36.406
Are you sure you're depressed?

35:38.847 --> 35:39.526
What do you mean?

35:41.647 --> 35:42.607
You think I'm lying?

35:45.166 --> 35:46.126
Do you dare to admit it?

35:47.446 --> 35:48.687
You're gaslighting me.

36:07.807 --> 36:09.246
Here you go.

36:09.727 --> 36:10.767
Why are you here again?

36:10.847 --> 36:11.927
I already got one.

36:12.166 --> 36:13.166
I can't eat anymore.

36:14.087 --> 36:14.566
Thank you.

36:20.647 --> 36:21.446
You want this?

36:28.326 --> 36:29.446
Where are your mom and dad?

36:30.526 --> 36:32.206
Do they let you eat things
from strangers?

36:32.767 --> 36:34.566
What if this guy is a bad person?

36:35.807 --> 36:37.807
I don't want it.

36:41.166 --> 36:42.286
Why are you being harsh?

36:44.286 --> 36:45.166
You had a quarrel?

36:45.687 --> 36:46.526
I didn't.

36:47.446 --> 36:49.087
I just scared him.

36:49.486 --> 36:50.526
Why?

36:50.887 --> 36:52.126
I told him not to bother me.

37:13.566 --> 37:14.446
If you need someone

37:14.767 --> 37:15.887
to talk with you,

37:15.967 --> 37:16.566
I can do that.

37:17.087 --> 37:17.647
No need.

37:18.767 --> 37:21.847
Finish this and go back early,
or your brother will trouble you again.

37:22.927 --> 37:23.767
You know him so well.

37:24.607 --> 37:25.526
Your brother

37:26.566 --> 37:27.206
wants bullfrog,

37:27.286 --> 37:27.847
just like

37:27.927 --> 37:29.366
my grandma wants sweet potatoes.

37:29.607 --> 37:30.526
She can't wait.

37:30.687 --> 37:31.567
If she wants it,

37:31.647 --> 37:32.847
she must have it immediately.

37:33.927 --> 37:34.406
I see.

37:36.647 --> 37:38.007
Your brother pays you 800 a day.

37:38.087 --> 37:39.128
Are you short of money?

37:39.647 --> 37:41.206
I want to be financially independent.

37:42.607 --> 37:43.727
Do you have a problem?

37:44.206 --> 37:44.727
No.

37:45.767 --> 37:46.687
Friend you on WeChat.

37:48.607 --> 37:49.847
(She just broke up.)

37:50.166 --> 37:51.607
(She can't wait, can she?)

37:52.246 --> 37:53.807
(She can't do)

37:53.927 --> 37:55.326
(without a boyfriend?)

37:55.687 --> 37:57.246
If there's a job, I'll think of you.

38:06.087 --> 38:07.767
Hey, you opened the payment code.

38:16.727 --> 38:17.687
I sent it.

38:19.566 --> 38:21.007
Chen Luzhou, right?

38:25.126 --> 38:27.166
I am Xu Zhi on Wechat.

38:31.847 --> 38:33.807
So, when can I go to your place?

38:38.326 --> 38:39.406
It's okay.

38:41.366 --> 38:42.486
Too fast.

38:42.566 --> 38:44.126
You said it at your doorstep.

38:44.687 --> 38:46.687
Friend you on WeChat,
and you'll let me hear you

38:46.767 --> 38:47.526
get scolded.

38:50.206 --> 38:51.126
You're persistent.

38:53.166 --> 38:54.567
My mom has been too busy lately

38:54.647 --> 38:55.566
to look after me.

38:56.486 --> 38:57.206
Otherwise,

38:57.286 --> 38:58.607
she won't leave his son to me.

38:59.526 --> 39:02.446
If you want to hear me getting scolded,
you'll have to wait.

39:06.206 --> 39:07.087
Looking forward to it.

39:10.647 --> 39:11.326
(Now,)

39:11.406 --> 39:12.847
(am I having an affair?)

39:25.319 --> 39:27.448
(Chen Luzhou.)

39:27.967 --> 39:30.526
There's nothing you can't do.

39:31.206 --> 39:33.286
I'll create a group.
You get Chen Luzhou in.

39:33.847 --> 39:34.647
What do you want?

39:35.727 --> 39:37.087
I know the two of you.

39:37.246 --> 39:39.166
You can make the conversation
a dead end.

39:39.566 --> 39:40.847
But it won't happen in a group.

39:40.967 --> 39:41.927
There's no silence.

39:42.446 --> 39:44.366
If you don't respond,
someone else always will.

39:46.456 --> 39:48.509
(Group chat)

39:50.727 --> 39:51.246
Let me reply.

39:52.206 --> 39:53.887
Let's earn money

39:54.047 --> 39:55.366
together.

40:01.607 --> 40:03.366
See, I told you.

40:03.967 --> 40:04.927
Cai Yingying,

40:05.206 --> 40:06.526
you've got something.

40:11.286 --> 40:13.847
(Change the name of group chat)
Get gold chains everywhere.

40:15.246 --> 40:15.967
This is not bad.

40:31.807 --> 40:33.126
Just now Zhu Yangqi asked me

40:33.366 --> 40:35.366
if you took Lucy
to plow the fields this afternoon.

40:35.446 --> 40:36.607
He looks exhausted.

40:37.246 --> 40:37.887
Really?

40:38.807 --> 40:40.366
He looked happy

40:40.446 --> 40:41.566
with the little girl.

40:46.767 --> 40:48.086
Given your tone,

40:48.166 --> 40:49.767
are you being jealous?

40:51.206 --> 40:52.446
What makes you say that?

40:57.047 --> 40:57.752
Who knows?

41:08.647 --> 41:11.126
Lucy, can I borrow your charging cable?

41:11.967 --> 41:13.047
I lent it to Xu Zhi.

41:13.927 --> 41:15.166
Can you get it back?

41:15.246 --> 41:16.126
It's urgent.

41:17.486 --> 41:17.887
Okay.

41:19.166 --> 41:20.807
Hurry up.

41:21.446 --> 41:22.767
I've already texted her.

41:25.486 --> 41:27.326
Sorry, I left it at the restaurant.

41:27.486 --> 41:28.807
I'll buy you a new one later.

41:31.047 --> 41:31.807
It's a trick.

41:32.087 --> 41:33.166
It's a total trick.

41:33.526 --> 41:34.847
She just created opportunities

41:34.927 --> 41:36.607
to see you again.

41:36.687 --> 41:37.967
She used that as an excuse.

41:38.847 --> 41:39.406
Lucy,

41:39.566 --> 41:41.526
you're in trouble now.

41:43.727 --> 41:45.087
Do we have something to drink?

41:47.206 --> 41:48.647
You usually don't drink beverages.

41:49.446 --> 41:50.366
I want to drink now.

41:50.607 --> 41:51.087
Can't I?

41:51.566 --> 41:53.326
Okay, I'll get it for you.

41:54.047 --> 41:54.687
Thanks.

41:57.246 --> 41:58.967
By the way, after you went out,

41:59.526 --> 42:01.046
why do you seem so gloomy now?

42:01.126 --> 42:01.887
What happened?

42:03.887 --> 42:05.406
It seems Xu Zhi and Tan Xu broke up.

42:06.087 --> 42:07.727
Chen Luzhou, it's none of your business.

42:07.807 --> 42:08.607
Why are you gloomy?

42:09.526 --> 42:10.847
Don't do something stupid.

42:12.166 --> 42:12.607
No.

42:13.246 --> 42:13.607
I...

42:13.687 --> 42:14.486
I don't know why.

42:15.727 --> 42:16.807
I just feel...

42:17.326 --> 42:18.087
What?

42:19.927 --> 42:21.086
I want to buy you food

42:21.166 --> 42:22.246
to not owe you a favor.

42:25.366 --> 42:26.767
Lead the way, then.

42:27.047 --> 42:28.486
If you need me to help explain,

42:28.647 --> 42:29.286
I can go.

42:29.887 --> 42:31.687
You order. I'll be right back.

42:33.767 --> 42:34.607
Friend you on WeChat.

42:36.607 --> 42:38.126
If there's a job, I'll think of you.

42:44.087 --> 42:44.847
I just

42:45.607 --> 42:46.526
can't refuse her.

42:47.967 --> 42:49.607
What do you mean by that?

42:49.767 --> 42:50.566
I don't know either.

42:50.927 --> 42:51.847
If I knew,

42:51.927 --> 42:53.126
I wouldn't be annoyed by her.

42:53.486 --> 42:54.767
She had a boyfriend,

42:55.007 --> 42:55.647
but she still...

42:55.967 --> 42:57.446
Are you annoyed by her?

42:58.087 --> 43:00.526
You're annoyed that she had a boyfriend.

43:03.246 --> 43:04.087
Let me tell you.

43:05.767 --> 43:07.526
Xu Zhi is indeed quite pretty.

43:08.126 --> 43:09.246
But the girls pursuing you

43:09.566 --> 43:10.526
are all pretty, right?

43:11.047 --> 43:11.607
Gu Yan

43:12.326 --> 43:13.607
is a gorgeous girl.

43:13.687 --> 43:14.807
Yet you refused her.

43:15.927 --> 43:16.887
So,

43:18.007 --> 43:18.967
Xu Zhi

43:19.126 --> 43:21.246
is different from other girls

43:21.807 --> 43:24.446
because she had a boyfriend.

43:26.406 --> 43:27.087
So?

43:27.526 --> 43:28.126
So,

43:28.687 --> 43:30.927
what you can't refuse
isn't actually her,

43:31.486 --> 43:32.246
well,

43:34.486 --> 43:35.246
but this kind of

43:36.166 --> 43:37.446
excitement.

43:37.887 --> 43:38.526
Well,

43:39.446 --> 43:41.246
it is like

43:42.486 --> 43:45.206
an unspeakable affair.

43:45.286 --> 43:45.807
Got it?

44:09.543 --> 44:12.388
(She's good)

44:13.030 --> 44:14.968
(at flirting.)

44:15.064 --> 44:21.880
(Is she trying to attract me?)

44:23.544 --> 44:29.360
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:29.912 --> 44:35.440
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:36.952 --> 44:41.400
♪The world is too quiet♪

44:42.392 --> 44:49.320
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

44:50.232 --> 44:55.320
♪Who will visit me♪

44:56.376 --> 45:02.000
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:02.744 --> 45:05.800
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:06.040 --> 45:11.360
♪Into concern and care♪

45:16.888 --> 45:22.000
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:22.520 --> 45:28.360
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:29.816 --> 45:33.200
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:33.336 --> 45:39.560
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:40.056 --> 45:43.000
♪The lonely clock♪

45:43.160 --> 45:47.760
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

45:48.152 --> 45:51.400
♪Are we both♪

45:51.672 --> 45:55.200
♪Attracted to each other♪

45:56.344 --> 46:02.960
♪Falling into you♪

46:06.680 --> 46:12.480
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:13.336 --> 46:16.000
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

46:16.536 --> 46:21.160
♪From reaching eternity♪

46:21.560 --> 46:24.840
♪After rushing recklessly♪

46:25.048 --> 46:28.480
♪We approach each other♪

46:29.752 --> 46:33.360
♪Without turning back♪

46:34.744 --> 46:42.400
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

46:43.032 --> 46:49.520
♪Falling into you♪
